          "locator": "data/vv/stage17_speedup.json",
          "role": "dataset",
          "sha256": "e1f273a8f8c1ec79c58822af2c27b0ff0137eb54ab2199e9d780fa87b7102561"
        },
        "text": "'Held out' means a deterministic same-grid re-solve that reproduces the loop's value bit for bit. It re-confirms the value; it adds no resolution."
      },
      {
        "id": "recorded-not-re-derivable",
        "kind": "statement",
